  if (moreThanOne.remove(cur)) {
    if (storages.size() == 1) {
      **

      final DatanodeStorageInfo remaining = storages.get(0);
      moreThanOne.remove(remaining);
      exactlyOne.add(remaining);

      **
    }
  } else {
    exactlyOne.remove(cur);
  }

`

In this case, moreThanOne list may\
4	  \ not contain the remaining block. The remaining block shouldn’t be deleted, but it is added to exactlyOne list. And then it will be deleted.

